translate spanish share_monika2_d31cc5a8:

    # m 1e "It's who you're trying to understand."
    m 1e "Se trata de a quién buscas comprender."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1154
translate spanish share_monika2_855e22a2:

    # m 5a "Anyway, here's my poem for today. I thought long and hard about this one."
    m 5a "De todas formas, aquí esta mi poema para hoy. Me lo pensé mucho antes de escribir este."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1155
translate spanish share_monika2_bcdf8cb6:

    # m "I hope it resonates with you."
    m "Espero que resuene en ti."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1157
translate spanish share_monika2_edc29184:

    # "Her gaze lingers on me a moment longer after I finish reading."
    "Su mirada se prolonga sobre mí un instante más tras finalizar mi lectura."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1158
translate spanish share_monika2_a479b9e8:

    # m 1g "...You know, sometimes it feels like we're all just pieces on a board, doesn't it?"
    m 1g "Sabes, a veces parece que solo somos unas simples piezas en un tablero, ¿no crees?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1159
translate spanish share_monika2_4f63761e:

    # m "Following moves that someone else already laid out."
    m "Avanzando según jugadas que alguien ya dejó decididas."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1160
translate spanish share_monika2_ceb99241:

    # m 1d "But maybe... maybe you're the one who gets to flip that board."
    m 1d "Pero quizá... quizá seas tú quién pueda cambiar todo eso."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1161
translate spanish share_monika2_0f1729ee:

    # m 5a "Just a thought~"
    m 5a "Solo es algo que se me ha pasado por la cabeza."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1162
translate spanish share_monika2_be84cbf4:

    # "Her smile lingers for a moment longer than it should."
    "Su sonrisa se prolonga un poco más de lo habitual."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1163
translate spanish share_monika2_91ff802d:

    # "Then she steps back, the classroom suddenly feeling a little colder in her absence."
    "Luego retrocede un poco, el salón se siente un poco más frío al quedarse sin ella."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1164
translate spanish share_monika2_d367371d:

    # "I stare down at her poem once more. Even without the strange formatting, it leaves me with a strange, uneasy energy- like I missed something vital hidden between the lines."
    "Le doy un vistazo a su poema otra vez. Aún sin tener ese formato tan extraño, deja en mí una inquietud, como si hubiese pasado por alto algo importante oculto entre las líneas."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1171
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_41093591:

    # s "Whew~! That was a lot of reading!"
    s "¡Fiu! ¡Menuda manera de leer tanto!"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1172
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_44fef564:

    # s 1m "I think my brain is starting to melt..."
    s 1m "Siento como si tuviera el cerebro frito..."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1175
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_c40618c4:

    # y "You should remember to pace yourself next time, Sayori."
    y "Deberías probar tomártelo con más calma para la próxima, Sayori."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1176
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_65d0c20f:

    # y "Rushing through too many poems can be mentally exhausting."
    y "Apresurarse a leer muchos poemas en un pispás puede ser agotador."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1177
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_6330df7c:

    # s 4r "Buuuut I didn't rush! I just... read really enthusiastically!"
    s 4r "¡Peeero no es que iba con prisa! Es solo que... ¡leo con muchas ganas!"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1181
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_b99f079a:

    # m "That's just Sayori's reading style~"
    m "Esa es la manera de leer de Sayori."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1182
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_0b66f04a:

    # m 1a "Though I think we could all use a little breather before we wrap up for today."
    m 1a "Aunque creo que a todos nos vendría bien un pequeño respiro antes de terminar."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1187
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_918a6cfa:

    # n "Hmph. If anyone's brain should be melting, it's mine from trying to figure out half your metaphors."
    n "Bah. Si alguien tendría que tener el cerebro frito, soy yo, de tanto intentar interpretar la mitad de tus metáforas."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1188
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_dde634e1:

    # y 2v "M-Metaphors are a fundamental literary device, Natsuki..."
    y 2v "L-las metáforas son artificios literarios de suma importancia, Natsuki."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1189
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_3d9f9c91:

    # n 5w "Yeah, yeah. Just don't expect me to need a dictionary every time I read something."
    n 5w "Ajá, sí. Solo no esperes que tenga un diccionario a mano cada que quiera leer algo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1190
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_14ac475d:

    # s 3q "Oooh! What if we made a club-wide challenge?"
    s 3q "¡Oh ya sé! ¿Qué tal si hacemos un reto para todo el club?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1191
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_c08632e7:

    # s "Like... everyone tries writing in someone else's style tomorrow!"
    s "En plan... ¡que mañana cada uno escriba un poema imitando el estilo de otro!"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1192
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_c3c1a349:

    # m 2b "That might actually be fun."
    m 2b "Puede que sea divertido."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1193
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_5a4fa40e:

    # m "It could help everyone experiment and maybe even gain some new perspective."
    m "Ayudaría a que todos experimentasen y que tal vez consigan otra manera de ver las cosas."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1194
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_bf55f450:

    # n 1h "Only if Yuri promises not to turn her 'Natsuki-style' poem into a gothic horror story."
    n 1h "Solo si Yuri promete que no hará de su poema “al estilo Natsuki” un relato gótico de terror."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1195
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_349f707c:

    # y 3t "I-I wouldn't...! I mean, I'd try to be faithful to your tone..."
    y 3t "¡N-no me atrevería! Digo, trataré de ser fiel a tu estilo..."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1196
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_0d77223d:

    # s 1l "Ehehe~ You two are so funny when you bicker!"
    s 1l "Je, je, je. ¡Sois tan graciosas cuando pelean!"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1197
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_8a9398ae:

    # m 2a "Alright, alright. Before Sayori instigates a full-blown poetry war..."
    m 2a "Vale, vale. Antes de que a Sayori le de por declarar una guerra de poesías."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1198
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_93bb0cfc:

    # m 2e "We should probably get ready to pack up."
    m 2e "Sería bueno si vamos recogiendo nuestras cosas para irnos."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1203
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_95a87f68:

    # n "...Actually, [mc], you free after school?"
    n "Por cierto, [mc], dime: ¿estás libre después del cole?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1204
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_d3e1494b:

    # mc "Huh? Uh, yeah, why?"
    mc "¿Eh? Eh, sí, ¿Por?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1205
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_f67a64d0:

    # n 1q "No reason. Just- if you don't have plans, maybe... you could come over or something."
    n 1q "Por nada. Es solo que... si no estás ocupado, quizás... podrías pasarte o algo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1206
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_faaaa5be:

    # mc "...Oh. Yeah, I'd be down."
    mc "Oh. Vale, me encantaría."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1207
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_a9eee2ab:

    # n 1w "Don't make it weird! We'll just hang out. Talk manga. Maybe bake something if you're lucky."
    n 1w "¡Lo haces sonar raro! Solo vamos a pasar el rato, nada más. Hablar de manga, igual podríamos hacer algo para hornear si pinta."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1208
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_67bccabd:

    # mc "Sounds like a plan."
    mc "Suena a una salida."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1211
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_fb54e7ba:

    # s "Awww~ Have fun you two!"
    s "¡Uyy! ¡Pasadlo genial los dos!"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1213
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_bdf897d8:

    # m "Let us know if you write any secret bonus poems while you're out~"
    m "Hagánnos saber si se escriben algún que otro poema de sobra en su escapadita."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1217
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_a881eef5:

    # "With a small but proud smile, Natsuki heads toward the door, and I follow close behind."
    "Con una pequeña pero orgullosa sonrisa, Natsuki se dirige a la puerta y la sigo de cerca."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1222
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_368deb39:

    # "After saying goodbye to the others, I follow Natsuki a few blocks away from school."
    "Luego de haberme despedido de las demás, sigo a Natsuki unas cuantas manzanas lejos de la escuela."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1223
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_0a45a26a:

    # "The sky's soft with the late afternoon sun. It's warm. Peaceful."
    "El cielo se endulza con el suave atardecer de hoy. Es cálido, tranquilo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1224
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_0bdc962f:

    # "But the closer we get to her place, the quieter she becomes."
    "Pero mientras más nos acercamos a su casa, más callada se pone."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1225
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_3b59372d:

    # "Her usual energy settles into something smaller. Not quite anxious- but not relaxed either."
    "El entusiasmo que suele mostrar siempre se va reduciendo a algo más reservado. No parece estar inquieta, pero tampoco se ve relajada."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1226
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_0f5542dd:

    # "I decide not to point it out."
    "Termino optando por no decirle nada al respecto."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1229
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_8fa6f8c1:

    # n "Alright, here we are. Try not to trip over anything. It's... kind of a mess."
    n "Vale, ya hemos llegado. Intenta no tropezarte con nada, está... todo muy patas arribas."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1230
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_8f65111e:

    # mc "Hey, I'm used to messes. You've seen my handwriting."
    mc "Tranquila, ya estoy curado de espantos con el desorden. Ya has visto la chapuza que es mi letra."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1231
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_895f4c8e:

    # n 1t "Heh... True."
    n 1t "Je... verdad."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1234
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_ed9399c0:

    # "She unlocks the door and leads me inside. It's quiet. Too quiet."
    "Ella abre la puerta y me lleva hacia adentro. Todo está muy silencioso, demasiado silencioso."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1235
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_bf0e02ca:

    # "There's a faint musty smell in the air, and though the place isn't dirty, it feels... neglected."
    "El aire arrastra un ligero olor a humedad, y pese a que no hay suciedad, el lugar transmite cierta sensación de... abandono."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1236
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_07839ac7:

    # "She kicks her shoes off with practiced caution, like she's walking on eggshells."
    "Ella se quita los zapatos con una delicadeza ya habitual, como si temiera hacer demasiado ruido."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1237
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_c9013ad5:

    # mc "You live here alone?"
    mc "¿Tú vives aquí sola?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1238
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_9d0f656d:

    # n 1q "W-What? No! I mean... no. My dad works a lot. He's... out right now."
    n 1q "¿Q-qué? ¡No! quiero decir... no. Mi padre trabaja mucho. Él está... afuera ahora mismo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1239
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_3cdbea8e:

    # "She doesn't meet my eyes when she says it."
    "Ella responde evitando contacto visual."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1240
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_dc16ebcd:

    # mc "Got it."
    mc "Entiendo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1241
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_1cc2c119:

    # "She walks ahead into the kitchen, and I trail behind."
    "Ella se va caminando hacia la cocina, y le acompaño por detrás."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1244
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_1556135b:

    # "Natsuki opens a cupboard and stands on her toes to reach something on the higher shelf."
    "Natsuki abre una alacena y se pone de puntillas para intentar alcanzar algo en el estante que está más arriba."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1245
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_85025686:

    # "Without thinking, I step forward to help, but she flinches slightly at the sound of my footstep."
    "Sin pensarlo ni un segundo, me acerco para ayudarla, pero ella se tensa un poco al escuchar mis pasos."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1246
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_49c94304:

    # mc "...Sorry."
    mc "... Perdona."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1247
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_a8ce11e9:

    # n 1u "It's fine."
    n 1u "No pasa nada."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1248
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_9c68c181:

    # "She retrieves a worn mixing bowl and places it gently on the counter."
    "Saca un viejo bol de cocina y lo pone sobre la mesa con cuidado."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1249
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_b062288f:

    # "The utensils she takes out next clatter more than they need to."
    "Los utensillos que ella coge luego resuenan más de lo debido al sacarlos."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1250
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_9a2a2462:

    # mc "You bake here often?"
    mc "¿Sueles hacer repostería aquí seguido?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1251
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_f054f363:

    # n 1c "Yeah. It's kinda the only thing I can do to clear my head sometimes."
    n 1c "Sí. Es de las pocas cosas que me sirve para despejar la mente a veces."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1252
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_70124df1:

    # n 1n "That... and manga."
    n 1n "Eso y... leer manga."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1253
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_89e90227:

    # "She smiles faintly, but it's small, and it doesn't quite reach her eyes."
    "Esboza una sonrisa con suavidad, pero pequeña, y sus ojos no terminan por reflejar esa sonrisa."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1254
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_3ae2eeb2:

    # n 1q "Anyway, I figured we could make something simple. Like cupcakes. If that's okay."
    n 1q "Vale, en fin. Resulta que me pareció mejor idea hacer algo simple, como pastelitos... si te parece bien."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1255
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_6984a011:

    # mc "Sounds perfect."
    mc "Va, suena estupendo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1256
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_93736a87:

    # "I grab ingredients as she names them, and soon we fall into a rhythm- flour, sugar, eggs, oil..."
    "Voy cogiendo los ingredientes que ella me va nombrando, y, al poco, todo empieza a seguir un ritmo: harina, azúcar, huevos, aceite..."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1257
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_20cd1318:

    # "It feels almost normal. But the silence in the house makes everything louder than it should be."
    "Se siente algo casi habitual. Pero el silencio que hay en la casa hace que todo sea más ruidoso de lo que debería."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1258
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_6fa47bcb:

    # "I catch her glancing at the clock once. Then twice."
    "Me percato que se da vuelta a mirar el reloj, una vez y luego otra."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1259
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_056feab1:

    # mc "...Expecting someone?"
    mc "... ¿Estás esperando visitas?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1261
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_7ebed199:

    # "Her shoulders tighten."
    "Sus hombros se tensan al instante."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1262
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_4fba8bfc:

    # n "No. Just checking the time. That's all."
    n "No. Solo me fijaba la hora, nada más."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1263
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_71e65b88:

    # "I nod, but I don't press."
    "Asiento, sin insistirle."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1265
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_a29b84a3:

    # "Eventually, the batter is ready. Natsuki starts spooning it into the tray with mechanical precision."
    "Al cabo de un rato, la masa está lista. Natsuki se pone a servirla en la bandeja con una precisión meticulosa."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1266
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_9f4dcdcf:

    # mc "Hey... thanks for inviting me over. This is nice."
    mc "Eh... gracias por haberme invitado a pasar. Me va gustando esto."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1267
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_9bae2033:

    # n 1t "Don't get the wrong idea. I just needed someone to help stir."
    n 1t "Pero no te hagas ideas raras, ¿eh? Solo necesitaba a alguien que me ayudara a mezclar."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1268
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_62fa9484:

    # mc "Sure, sure."
    mc "Si, si... lo que tú digas."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1269
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_39ceafee:

    # "She huffs, but there's a hint of warmth behind it."
    "Ella resopla enfadada, aunque deja entrever cierta ternura."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1270
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_2b8e8e75:

    # n 1m "I guess... it's not the worst thing. Having someone around."
    n 1m "Supongo... que no está tan mal tener a alguien haciendote compañia."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1271
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_27fbc0b2:

    # "She slides the tray into the oven and sets the timer, then wipes her hands with a towel."
    ""

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1272
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_74f0e891:

    # n 2c "We've got a bit while they bake."
    n 2c "Todavía tenemos algo de tiempo hasta que se haga."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1273
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_7644fc81:

    # mc "Want to show me your room?"
    mc "¿Quieres mostrarme tu cuarto?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1274
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_aa3c3c2a:

    # n 1h "Wha-?!"
    n 1h "¿¡Qué!?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1275
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_456694a3:

    # "She stares at me, flustered."
    "Me mira, sonrojada."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1276
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_5a31cdf7:

    # n 5x "I-It's not like that! Geez..."
    n 5x "¡P-por ahí no va! Jo..."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1277
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_73fbca48:

    # mc "Just figured we could hang out somewhere that's not filled with kitchen heat."
    mc "Solo pensé que quizá podríamos pasar el rato en algún sitio donde no haga tanto calor."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1278
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_8e7baf2c:

    # "She grumbles under her breath, then turns toward the hallway."
    "Ella resopla con enfado, para luego darse la vuelta hacia el pasillo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1279
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_4e8f201b:

    # n 1q "...Fine. But don't touch anything, got it?"
    n 1q "... Está bien. Pero no toques nada, ¿vale?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1280
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_da126dfc:

    # "I raise my hands in mock surrender as I follow her deeper into the house."
    "Alzo las manos en un gesto de rendición en forma de burla mientras la sigo por el interior de la casa."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1282
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_8e7c2add:

    # "Her room is small, cramped even, but it's filled with little bursts of color- manga volumes stacked in precise rows, bright pillows, and baking trophies on the shelf."
    "Su habitación es pequeña, incluso algo agobiante diría, pero está llena de pequeños toques de color: tomos de manga apilados en filas perfectamente ordenadas, cojines de colores vivos y trofeos de repostería sobre la estantería."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1283
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_09624779:

    # "It feels like someone trying to carve out a space of their own. A safe one."
    "Parece un pequeño rincón hecho por alguien que solo quiere sentirse seguro."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1285
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_ae192c83:

    # n "Told you it wasn't much."
    n "Ya te avisé de que no era para tanto."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1286
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_384f4c28:

    # mc "No, it's nice. Really."
    mc "No, mola bastante la verdad."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1287
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_a8bbc09b:

    # "She sits on the edge of the bed, arms crossed, looking down."
    "Se deja caer en el borde de la cama, cruzándose de brazos mientras mira al suelo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1288
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_4882941d:

    # n 1q "You ever feel like... no matter what you do, you're just... stuck?"
    n 1q "¿No te pasa que, a veces, sientes que... da igual lo que hagas, simplemente estás… atrapado?"

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1289
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_2cc7b95a:

    # "I blink."
    "Parpadeo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1290
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_ae25da23:

    # mc "Yeah. Sometimes."
    mc "Sí, a veces."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1292
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_ef222251:

    # "The moment lingers... quiet, vulnerable."
    "El momento se prolonga... tranquilo, íntimo."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1294
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_d35e5301:

    # "Before I can say more, there's a sharp {i}click{/i}... like a glitch in a silent room."
    "Antes de que continúe, se oye un extraño {i}clic{/i}... como un fallo en medio de una habitación en silencio."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1300
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_714cc1a9:

    # "The screen flickers. Just once."
    "La pantalla parpadea. Una sola vez."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1301
translate spanish after_poem_sharing2_b25f6732:

    # "Natsuki stiffens."
    "Natsuki se congela."

# game/RewrittenFate.rpy:1302
